clock show
clock set 100
clock set 50
clock advance 90
clock advance 2m
clock advance 1h
clock advance 1d
clock advance 0
clock advance 10w
clock set x
clock
frobnicate
check
check nowhere u doc:read /a
set create s
check s u doc /a
check s u doc:read a
check s u doc:read /a k
check s u doc:read /a k=1 k=2
check s bad/subject doc:read /a
verify
help check
help nope
